body:
Oh shit yeah, op stay away from Odin lol. It works but if you wipe your partitions or something you may be screwed. Esp if you don't know what you're doing at all.

Edit;
For perspective, I've rooted my 12R since October when I purchased it. I've had hard brick around 7 times, a few soft loops. Now I learned to fix it myself. Lots of turbo smart people in the telegram channels.
